# Implementations Layout

This folder defines implementation layout and packaging rules for MAMBA-Sign API_PKC submission.

## Directory rules

- `Reference_Implementation/`: per-instance ISO C reference implementation directories.
- `Optimized_Implementation/`: per-instance 64-bit optimized implementation directories.
- `Additional_Implementation/`: reserved location for optional additional implementations.

## Build model

- Every instance directory is self-contained and can run independently with:
  - `make clean`
  - `make`
  - `./KAT_SIG`

## Official file policy

- Official template files `drng.c`, `drng.h`, `auxfunc.c`, `auxfunc.h`, `KAT_SIG.c` should remain unmodified in semantics.
- Randomness is routed through official DRNG adaptation (`randombytes` bridge to `get_random_number`).
